{
    "title": "Frontline Wildfire Tracker",
    "description": "The Frontline Wildfire Defense app is a FREE comprehensive wildfire information resource that helps protect you, your family and your home from wild fire disasters. The frontline mobile app provides the situational awareness you need to navigate wildfires, both before and during the fire season. Wildfire maps, weather, fire danger indexes, event notifications, emergency contact groups and preparation checklists are some of the key features in the Frontline app that allow you to better prepare for the wildfire season.\r\n\r\nFire Situational Awareness Dashboard\r\nAt a glance, the dashboard provides key information about your wildfire situation and easy access to helpful features. Key wildfire related alerts are displayed on the dashboard together with fire weather, air quality, fire danger indexes, access to your personal emergency contact groups, and preparation checklists.\r\n\r\nWildfire Map and Information\r\nThe fire map allows you to see and track wild fires that may threaten your home and your loved ones. You're able to gather more information about the fire such as location of fire perimeter, fire name, containment, acres burned, and latest updates. Watch fires and get the latest updates. See California wildfire evacuation warnings and orders, red flag warnings, fire weather watch and more. This fire tracker gives you all the information you need to safely navigate wild fire in your area.\r\n\r\nFire Preparation Checklists\r\nPrepare yourself, your family and your home for wildfire by using the Frontline Wildfire preparation checklists. The Frontline mobile app guides you step-by-step through specific tasks to better prepare you, your family and your home for fire events.\r\n\r\nEmergency Contact Groups\r\nBy creating an Emergency Contact Group, you can invite your friends, family and loved ones to receive and share the notifications that are critical during the wildfire season. Emergency alerts are sent to all people in the group whenever a fire event is near.\r\n\r\nFire Alert Notifications\r\nGet all of the latest emergency alert notifications in one place when it comes to wildfires in your area. You can expect notices about new fires, red flag warnings, fire weather watches, lightning, evacuations and more when you need them.\r\n\r\nFrontline Wildfire Home Defense System\r\nFor those who choose to install a Frontline Home Defense System, the Frontline Wildfire Defense app will also provide monitoring and remote control features for that system. The Home Defense System uses water and a biodegradable Class A firefighting foam to hydrate the materials of your home and surrounding areas to prevent ember ignition and spot fires. With redundant communications (WiFi, cellular, satellite) and power (backup battery) systems built in, the Frontline Wildfire Home Defense System enables you to maintain control and protect your home throughout a wildfire event. To learn more, visit frontlinewildfire.com.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Frontline mobile app will give you all the wild fire information you need to keep you safe. Join the Frontline Wildfire Defense mission today to protect yourself, your family and your home from wildfire disaster!\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.frontlinewildfire.com/terms-of-use/",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Frontline Wildfire Defense app is a FREE comprehensive wildfire information resource that helps protect you, your family and your home from wild fire disasters. The frontline mobile app provides the situational awareness you need to navigate wildfires, both before and during the fire season. Wildfire maps, weather, fire danger indexes, event notifications, emergency contact groups and preparation checklists are some of the key features in the Frontline app that allow you to better prepare for the wildfire season.<br><br>Fire Situational Awareness Dashboard<br>At a glance, the dashboard provides key information about your wildfire situation and easy access to helpful features. Key wildfire related alerts are displayed on the dashboard together with fire weather, air quality, fire danger indexes, access to your personal emergency contact groups, and preparation checklists.<br><br>Wildfire Map and Information<br>The fire map allows you to see and track wild fires that may threaten your home and your loved ones. You&#39;re able to gather more information about the fire such as location of fire perimeter, fire name, containment, acres burned, and latest updates. Watch fires and get the latest updates. See California wildfire evacuation warnings and orders, red flag warnings, fire weather watch and more. This fire tracker gives you all the information you need to safely navigate wild fire in your area.<br><br>Fire Preparation Checklists<br>Prepare yourself, your family and your home for wildfire by using the Frontline Wildfire preparation checklists. The Frontline mobile app guides you step-by-step through specific tasks to better prepare you, your family and your home for fire events.<br><br>Emergency Contact Groups<br>By creating an Emergency Contact Group, you can invite your friends, family and loved ones to receive and share the notifications that are critical during the wildfire season. Emergency alerts are sent to all people in the group whenever a fire event is near.<br><br>Fire Alert Notifications<br>Get all of the latest emergency alert notifications in one place when it comes to wildfires in your area. You can expect notices about new fires, red flag warnings, fire weather watches, lightning, evacuations and more when you need them.<br><br>Frontline Wildfire Home Defense System<br>For those who choose to install a Frontline Home Defense System, the Frontline Wildfire Defense app will also provide monitoring and remote control features for that system. The Home Defense System uses water and a biodegradable Class A firefighting foam to hydrate the materials of your home and surrounding areas to prevent ember ignition and spot fires. With redundant communications (WiFi, cellular, satellite) and power (backup battery) systems built in, the Frontline Wildfire Home Defense System enables you to maintain control and protect your home throughout a wildfire event. To learn more, visit frontlinewildfire.com.<br><br><br>The Frontline mobile app will give you all the wild fire information you need to keep you safe. Join the Frontline Wildfire Defense mission today to protect yourself, your family and your home from wildfire disaster!<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.frontlinewildfire.com/terms-of-use/",
